        Architecture and configuration placeholders only -- no endpoint, file layout, folder path, filename convention, or transmission schedule is invented below. Every field starts blank. Nothing in this codebase currently acts on these values; they exist so a real SFTP client can be wired in later without rebuilding the module around it. The secret is encrypted at rest (App\Core\Encryption), same as every other Creditinfo/Collexia credential.
      </p>
      <div class="row g-3 mb-2">
